<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Donate'}) %>
<section class="wrap" style="padding:38px 0 70px"><div class="donate-pro-hero"><div class="donate-pro-copy"><span class="pro-eyebrow">Give hope</span><h1>Help care reach someone who needs it.</h1><p>Your support helps CSNF educate communities, encourage earlier detection, stand with patients and families, and celebrate survivorship across Ghana.</p><div class="pro-actions"><a class="pro-btn rose" href="#ways-to-give">Ways to give ↓</a><a class="pro-btn light" href="/contact">Talk to our team →</a></div></div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488521787991-ed7bbaae773c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=88" alt="Community support and generosity"></div></section>
<section id="ways-to-give" class="pro-section soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="pro-heading"><div><span class="pro-eyebrow">Ways to give</span><h2>Simple ways to support the mission.</h2></div></div><div class="payment-grid"><article class="payment-card"><small>Mobile Money</small><h3><%= site.momo || site.phone %></h3><p>Support CSNF locally through Mobile Money. Confirm the recipient name before sending.</p></article><article class="payment-card"><small>Zelle</small><h3><%= site.zelle %></h3><p>A convenient option for supporters in the diaspora.</p></article><article class="payment-card"><small>Cash App</small><h3><%= site.cashapp %></h3><p>Every contribution helps strengthen awareness and patient support.</p></article></div><p style="font-size:.78rem;color:#7a8681;margin-top:18px">For substantial gifts or corporate sponsorships, please confirm payment details directly with CSNF before sending funds.</p></div></section>
<section class="pro-section wrap"><div class="pro-heading"><div><span class="pro-eyebrow">What your support powers</span><h2>Giving becomes action.</h2></div></div><div class="donate-impact-grid"><div class="donate-impact"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1538108149393-fbbd81895907?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=86" alt="Health screening"><span>Screening & early detection</span></div><div class="donate-impact"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559757148-5c350d0d3c56?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=86" alt="Patient support"><span>Patient & family support</span></div><div class="donate-impact"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=86" alt="Community care"><span>Community awareness</span></div></div></section>
<section class="pro-cta wrap"><div><span class="pro-eyebrow" style="color:#f6dce6">Partner with purpose</span><h2>Want to make a larger impact?</h2></div><div><p>We welcome corporate sponsorships, institutional partnerships and support for community outreach.</p><a class="pro-btn light" href="/contact">Start a conversation ↗</a></div></section>
